{"html":"<article class=\"ec-renew container-site\"><nav aria-label=\"Breadcrumb\"><a href=\"/zh/\">首页 →</a></nav><header><p class=\"ec-renew-kicker\">采购与项目规划</p><h1>海滨活动杯：容器与携带选型</h1><p class=\"ec-renew-lead\">选个人杯或共用饮品器具前，先确认允许的服务区域、容器规定与清理安排。</p><a href=\"/zh/contact/\">准备项目询盘 →</a></header><figure class=\"ec-renew-photo\"><img src=\"/img/renewal/application-illustration-20261026.webp\" width=\"1200\" height=\"800\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" alt=\"活动饮品服务视觉示意\"><figcaption>生成活动概念示意，非客户活动或完成订单实拍。</figcaption></figure><section class=\"ec-renew-section\"><h2>按实际服务方式选型</h2><p>核对份量、杯盖与吸管配置、携带和归还或处置点，不由海滨主题推断防沙、密封或保温性能。</p></section><section class=\"ec-renew-section\"><h2>把选型条件写进需求</h2><div class=\"ec-renew-table-wrap\"><table><thead><tr><th>采购项</th><th>确认内容</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>饮品与场地</td><td>饮品、单次份量、容器规定、使用区域及清理安排。</td></tr><tr><td>型号与组件</td><td>杯型、材料、杯盖或吸管、服务工具及数量。</td></tr><tr><td>图稿与批准</td><td>图稿版本、颜色参考、实际样品和核对项目。</td></tr><tr><td>包装与交付</td><td>个人发放或服务点配置、包装、交货地及到货日期。</td></tr></tbody></table></div></section><section class=\"ec-renew-section\"><h2>继续比较产品与证据</h2><a href=\"/zh/custom-tumblers/\">查看相关器型与型号 →</a><a href=\"/zh/certificates/\">咨询项目文件 →</a></section><section class=\"ec-scenario-index container-site\" id=\"scenario-models\"><p class=\"ec-scenario-kicker\">按型号继续比较</p><h2>此场景的参考型号</h2><p>共 55 款建议参考型号。展开产品类型查看；进入详情页核对选用理由与项目要求。</p><p class=\"ec-scenario-note\">这些是采购规划建议，不代表所有型号适用于相同饮品、温度或操作条件。</p><div class=\"ec-scenario-model-groups\"><details class=\"ec-scenario-model-group\"><summary>折叠杯 <span>(8)</span></summary><ul class=\"ec-scenario-model-list\"><li><a href=\"/zh/products/collapsible-mug/\"><strong>GJZD-009</strong><span>折叠马克杯(Mug)</span></a></li><li><a href=\"/zh/products/frontier-ultralight-collapsible/\"><strong>GJZD-010</strong><span>折叠杯(Cup) 400ml</span></a></li><li><a href=\"/zh/products/hydaway-collapsible-pint/\"><strong>GJZD-014</strong><span>Hydaway 折叠啤酒杯 16oz</span></a></li><li><a href=\"/zh/products/hydaway-collapsible-tumbler-with-lid/\"><strong>GJZD-016</strong><span>Hydaway 折叠随行杯带盖 16oz</span></a></li><li><a href=\"/zh/products/hydaway-collapsible-insulated-drink-tumbler/\"><strong>GJZD-017</strong><span>Hydaway 折叠隔热随行杯 16oz</span></a></li><li><a href=\"/zh/products/ineeds-silicone-wine-glass/\"><strong>GJZD-018</strong><span>Ineeds 硅胶折叠红酒杯</span></a></li><li><a href=\"/zh/products/ineeds-collapsible-silicone-cup/\"><strong>GJZD-019</strong><span>Ineeds 折叠硅胶杯 350ml</span></a></li><li><a href=\"/zh/products/jin-sheu-collapsible-portable-silicone-water/\"><strong>GJZD-021</strong><span>金穗 折叠便携硅胶杯</span></a></li></ul></details><details class=\"ec-scenario-model-group\"><summary>吸管马克杯 <span>(4)</span></summary><ul class=\"ec-scenario-model-list\"><li><a href=\"/zh/products/oliver-acrylic-mug-with-straw/\"><strong>SJB-024</strong><span>户外超大号啤酒随行杯</span></a></li><li><a href=\"/zh/products/carter-acrylic-mug-with-straw/\"><strong>SJB-025</strong><span>户外超大号啤酒随行杯</span></a></li><li><a href=\"/zh/products/clair-acrylic-mug-with-straw/\"><strong>SJB-049</strong><span>30oz 双层再生环保带柄吸管杯 30oz</span></a></li><li><a href=\"/zh/products/envy-tritan-mug-with-straw/\"><strong>SJSB-001</strong><span>定制48oz双层Tritan带柄吸管杯（美国产）</span></a></li></ul></details><details class=\"ec-scenario-model-group\"><summary>随行杯 <span>(43)</span></summary><ul class=\"ec-scenario-model-list\"><li><a href=\"/zh/products/silicone-16oz-tumbler/\"><strong>BPJJ-012</strong><span>硅胶随行杯 16 oz</span></a></li><li><a href=\"/zh/products/customized-silicone-16oz-straw/\"><strong>GJB-007</strong><span>带吸管硅胶随行杯</span></a></li><li><a href=\"/zh/products/silicone-22oz-straw-tumbler/\"><strong>GJB-014</strong><span>带吸管硅胶随行杯</span></a></li><li><a href=\"/zh/products/silicone-32oz-straw-tumbler/\"><strong>GJB-015</strong><span>带吸管硅胶随行杯</span></a></li><li><a href=\"/zh/products/silicone-16oz-glow-in-gjb025/\"><strong>GJB-025</strong><span>硅胶夜光杯</span></a></li><li><a href=\"/zh/products/16-oz-economy-mood-tumbler/\"><strong>BSB-015</strong